    "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Release</h1><p>Buster's Tower Defense is officially released! Celebrate with an exclusive 40% off discount only on Steam.<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the next evolution of tower defense gameplay with Busters TD!</strong></h2></u><br>Embrace the innovative spirit of indie gaming with <strong>Busters Tower Defense</strong>, where strategy meets chaos in a physics-driven world. With an emphasis on replayability and crazy gameplay, dive into a game that stands tall among other TD classics.<br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense Experience with Endless Possibilities</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every playthrough challenges your strategic prowess. Can you position your towers to win or will you take advantage of glitches to break your enemies spirits?</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/d03bd6d86e47615d40f5400c4cf1f93f.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/d03bd6d86e47615d40f5400c4cf1f93f.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Physics That Amplify the Fun</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics-based interactions ensure that no two battles are the same. Master the mayhem to outmaneuver and obliterate your adversaries.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/21d9b63f756e55758585e14bf1d297fd.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/21d9b63f756e55758585e14bf1d297fd.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand, Fortify, and Dominate</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grow your base and deploy an array of towers. Harness the power of your personal drone for strategic advantage and secure victory over your enemies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/bf8d8d4af7e8e05101a08e3a8d802852.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/bf8d8d4af7e8e05101a08e3a8d802852.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization at Your Fingertips</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design and personalize your enemies. Upload images to decide who you'll be fighting against.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It's not just tower defense, it's Buster's world, and it's waiting for you to conquer it. Your strategy, your victories. Welcome to the next-gen of tower defense\u2014where you don't just play the game, you shape it.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the next evolution of tower defense gameplay with Busters TD!</strong></h2></u><br>Embrace the innovative spirit of indie gaming with <strong>Busters Tower Defense</strong>, where strategy meets chaos in a physics-driven world. With an emphasis on replayability and crazy gameplay, dive into a game that stands tall among other TD classics.<br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Tower Defense Experience with Endless Possibilities</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every playthrough challenges your strategic prowess. Can you position your towers to win or will you take advantage of glitches to break your enemies spirits?</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/d03bd6d86e47615d40f5400c4cf1f93f.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/d03bd6d86e47615d40f5400c4cf1f93f.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Physics That Amplify the Fun</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics-based interactions ensure that no two battles are the same. Master the mayhem to outmaneuver and obliterate your adversaries.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/21d9b63f756e55758585e14bf1d297fd.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/21d9b63f756e55758585e14bf1d297fd.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand, Fortify, and Dominate</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grow your base and deploy an array of towers. Harness the power of your personal drone for strategic advantage and secure victory over your enemies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/bf8d8d4af7e8e05101a08e3a8d802852.poster.avif?t=1706056220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316530/extras/bf8d8d4af7e8e05101a08e3a8d802852.webm?t=1706056220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><u><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization at Your Fingertips</h2></strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design and personalize your enemies. Upload images to decide who you'll be fighting against.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It's not just tower defense, it's Buster's world, and it's waiting for you to conquer it. Your strategy, your victories. Welcome to the next-gen of tower defense\u2014where you don't just play the game, you shape it.</strong></h2>",
